0 Helmet Dome, No Stud
0 Name: 5648.dat
0 Author: Tsumiki project (hand-made; not an LDraw.org part)
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Part
0 !LICENSE Licensed under CC BY 4.0 : see CAreadme.txt

0 BFC CERTIFY CCW

0 !KEYWORDS Woodstock, Peanuts, 21368, 5648pr0001

0 // Hand-made for LEGO 21368 (Woodstock's head): neither the official LDraw library nor
0 // the unofficial tracker has 5648. Shape from the part's published dimensions:
0 //   Brick Owl catalogue, LEGO Helmet Dome (5648), https://brickowl.com/catalog/lego-helmet-dome-5648
0 //   0.5 x 0.5 x 0.6 in = 12.7 x 12.7 x 15.2 mm = 31.75 x 31.75 x 38 LDU.
0 //   Proportions agree with the part picture in the 21368 manual (width/length 0.83).
0 // Form: closed capsule end (cylinder + hemisphere), open at the bottom, fits over a
0 // minifig head. Origin and axes = the minifig head it covers (head top / stud base at
0 // y=0, -y up), so the dome takes the same transform as its head. Inside: cavity r=13
0 // (head radius) up to y=0, socket r=6 for the head's top stud up to y=-4, and the small
0 // vent hole at the tip shown in the manual. No stud on the outside.
0 // Eye print of 5648pr0001 (black ovals) is not modelled.

